  "instructions": [
    "Combine herring, potato, eggs, and parmesan cheese in a mixing bowl. Mix well until a dough forms, then knead for 5 minutes until smooth.",
    "Divide the dough into 4 equal pieces, then roll each piece into a long rope.",
    "Cut the ropes into 1-inch pieces to form the gnocchi.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the gnocchi and cook for 2-3 minutes on each side until golden brown.",
    "Add the white wine and cook until the liquid is nearly evaporated, stirring occasionally.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley and serve hot."
